00:19:09.670 --> 00:19:13.040
Wow, Michelle's lesson was intense.

00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:15.750
It really lived up to the rumors.

00:19:15.750 --> 00:19:18.760
Especially after Gary-san left.

00:19:18.760 --> 00:19:22.890
